(LDO 1A \(VREG_L1A_1P0\): 1.0V clean analog rail for PLL | Diode: 390mV) Tj T*
(LDO 5A \(VREG_L5A_1P8\): 1.8V digital sensor & pull-up supply | Diode: 450mV) Tj T*
